cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pyFDS-Evac"
abstract: >-
  Fire Dynamics Simulator (FDS) evacuation modeling with visibility
  analysis. Couples a finished FDS run to JuPedSim agents: smoke slows
  them, dose stops them, smoke along a route changes their exit, and sign
  legibility decides which exits they know.
